  ├─→ score_node() applies MERGED rubric:
  │     FINANCE: AUM +25, PM title +15, healthcare portfolio +10 = 50
  │     CLINICAL: Phase 3 found +20, biotech focus +10 = 30
  │     TOTAL: 80 → Challenger framework
  │
  └─→ write_node() generates email using ALL signals:
        "RA Capital's $200M bet on Recursion's Phase 3 trial (NCT04XXXX)
         suggests you see the same gap in recursive drug discovery..."
```

